# .github/workflows/ci.yml audit-job flags) with this file EMPTY, and
# all 16 entries were removed.
#
# Bookworm's remaining CRITICAL/HIGH CVEs (e.g. perl-base
# CVE-2026-13221, zlib1g CVE-2023-45853, libsqlite3-0 CVE-2025-7458)
# are all UNFIXED upstream — the gate's `ignore-unfixed: true` excludes
